    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "In this scene you can see a character which has a single dna name controlling 
    bonePoses, blendShapes, scale, diffuse color and fading a normal map.\n\n*Change
    the dna 'ELFORALIEN' to see the results.*\n\nBefore UMA 2.8 all of these needed
    to have different dna assets and different dna converter behaviours, but now
    all these converters can live inside the same 'ConverterController' (assigned
    to the behaviour) and thus use the same dna names. \n\nYou can also assign ConverterBehaviours
    using the new 'ConverterController' to a slots DNA. Check out the 'MakeMeFatJeans'
    to see an example!\n\nEnable 'ElfToAlienDirector' to see this working with Timeline."
